{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11850","headline":"送李功曹之荆州充郑侍御判官重赠 · 杜甫","name":"送李功曹之荆州充郑侍御判官重赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾闻宋玉宅，每欲到荆州。\n此地生涯晚，遥悲水国秋。\n孤城一柱观，落日九江流。\n使者虽光彩，青枫远自愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_11850.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11850","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}